---@description "미니게임 규칙 상태를 공통 결과 계약으로 변환하는 로직"
@Logic
script MiniGameResultResolver extends Logic

	property string RESOLVER_OBJECTIVE = "ObjectiveResult"

	property string RESOLVER_ACCURACY = "AccuracyResult"

	property string RESOLVER_MESO_DRAW = "MesoDraw"

	property string REASON_TIMEOUT = "timeout"

	property string REASON_CANCEL = "cancel"

	property string REASON_MAP_CHANGE = "mapChange"

	property string REASON_RESTART = "restart"

	property string REASON_DRAIN = "drain"

	method boolean Supports(string resolverId)
		-- 공용 결과 처리기 지원 여부 확인
		return resolverId == self.RESOLVER_OBJECTIVE
			or resolverId == self.RESOLVER_ACCURACY
			or resolverId == self.RESOLVER_MESO_DRAW
	end

	method any Resolve(string resolverId, any state, any objectiveSummary, string reason)
		-- 규칙 상태와 Objective 요약을 기존 결과 필드로 변환
		if self:Supports(resolverId) == false then
			return nil
		end

		local sourceState = state or {}
		local summary = objectiveSummary or {}
		local progress = summary.progress or 0
		if progress < 0 then
			progress = 0
		elseif progress > 1 then
			progress = 1
		end

		local isSuccess = summary.allRequiredMet == true
		if sourceState.requestedSuccess ~= nil then
			isSuccess = sourceState.requestedSuccess == true
		end
		if self:IsFailureReason(reason) == true then
			isSuccess = false
		end
		if resolverId == self.RESOLVER_MESO_DRAW then
			isSuccess = (sourceState.blockDrawCount or 0) > 0 and self:IsFailureReason(reason) == false
		end

		return {
			isSuccess = isSuccess,
			score = math.floor(progress * 100),
			progress = progress,
			accuracy = sourceState.lastAccuracy or "",
			reason = reason or ""
		}
	end

	method boolean IsFailureReason(string reason)
		-- 정상 목표 완료가 아닌 강제 종료 사유 확인
		return reason == self.REASON_TIMEOUT
			or reason == self.REASON_CANCEL
			or reason == self.REASON_MAP_CHANGE
			or reason == self.REASON_RESTART
			or reason == self.REASON_DRAIN
	end

end
